<https://w3id.org/perkonto/molbio> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/molbio> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://w3id.org/perkonto> .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/molbio> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Anonymous Author" .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/molbio> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Anonymous Author" .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/molbio> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Anonymous Author" .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/molbio> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Anonymous Author" .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/molbio> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A domain extension of PERKOnto for the professional knowledge of a molecular biologist as extractable from personal email communications. It reuses the PERKOnto backbone and specialises the scientific layer into experimental-biology concepts (BiologicalEntity/BiologicalSample/ExperimentalTechnique/Readout/ResearchProblem) plus supporting concepts (Reagent, Instrument, Protocol)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/molbio> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/molbio> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "PERKOnto-MolBio: Molecular Biology extension of PERKOnto"@en .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/molbio> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0" .
